OL,3,GNEWSAI've had a constant headache for
OL,4,Atwo years due to my rare condition
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man says his rare neurological
OL,7,Fcondition means he has lived with a
OL,8,Fconstant headache for two years.
OL,10,FRhys Richards, 30, has hemicrania
OL,11,Fcontinua which means his headache lasts
OL,12,F"from morning, noon until night", he
OL,13,Fsaid.
OL,15,FWhile treatment in Liverpool has
OL,16,Fprovided some relief, he has to travel
OL,17,Fseveral hours there from his home in
OL,18,FBodedern, Anglesey.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
