OL,3,GNEWSAI've had a constant headache for
OL,4,Atwo years due to my rare condition
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Welsh government said it recognises
OL,7,Fthe debilitating effects of chronic
OL,8,Fheadaches and that it would continue to
OL,9,Fwork with NHS organisations to support
OL,10,Fcross-border healthcare where it was in
OL,11,Fthe best interests of patients.
